&lt;p data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;852&quot;&gt;As the&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Director of Product &amp;amp; Test Engineering, you will lead Astera Labs&#39; Product and Test Engineering organization supporting new product introductions (NPI) and high-volume manufacturing across our Asia OSAT partners. You will build and develop a high-performing engineering team responsible for product qualification, ATE test development, characterization, yield improvement, and manufacturing support throughout the product lifecycle. Working closely with Design Engineering, Silicon Validation, Quality, Manufacturing, and Supply Chain teams, you will drive operational excellence while ensuring successful product execution and customer delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
