&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14wybrm&quot; data-start=&quot;889&quot; data-end=&quot;1026&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Minimum of 12+ years of experience in post-silicon product development dealing with high-speed XCVR (product, test, or validation).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mbjop4&quot; data-start=&quot;1027&quot; data-end=&quot;1073&quot;&gt;
