&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kzwdop&quot; data-start=&quot;1074&quot; data-end=&quot;1166&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of leadership experience managing Product and Test Engineering organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5qmhnu&quot; data-start=&quot;1167&quot; data-end=&quot;1253&quot;&gt;
