&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jlte2a&quot; data-start=&quot;1254&quot; data-end=&quot;1366&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong academic/technical background in Electrical or Computer Engineering; Bachelor&#39;s required; MS preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;h0k622&quot; data-start=&quot;1367&quot; data-end=&quot;1474&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong problem-solving skills involving system-level analysis with test hardware, test programs, and DUT.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nz7a1d&quot; data-start=&quot;1475&quot; data-end=&quot;1524&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital and analog circuit-level understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;r9hy81&quot; data-start=&quot;1525&quot; data-end=&quot;1606&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication, leadership, and cross-functional collaboration skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-section-id=&quot;hmpmoc&quot; data-start=&quot;1613&quot; data-end=&quot;1640&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1642&quot; data-end=&quot;2559&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mt75hu&quot; data-start=&quot;1642&quot; data-end=&quot;1729&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build, lead, and grow a strong Product &amp;amp; Test Engineering organization in Taiwan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;se5h2q&quot; data-start=&quot;1730&quot; data-end=&quot;1807&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define engineering priorities and resource planning supporting NPI and HVM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d64fdz&quot; data-start=&quot;1808&quot; data-end=&quot;1954&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven track record supporting seamless production of semiconductor products through global OSAT partners across the complete product lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2p3s6i&quot; data-start=&quot;1955&quot; data-end=&quot;2058&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with Advantest V93000 ATE platform and developing wafer sort/final test programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dyphu2&quot; data-start=&quot;2059&quot; data-end=&quot;2155&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong knowledge of PCIe Gen4+, PAM4 SerDes, Ethernet (25G+), and/or LPDDR4/LPDDR5 interfaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5918ew&quot; data-start=&quot;2156&quot; data-end=&quot;2254&quot;&gt;
