&lt;h3 class=&quot;wnfdnth _1ibi0s33y _1ibi0s34u&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Astera Labs is seeking a highly strategic and commercially focused &lt;strong&gt;Director, Pricing Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; to define and drive the company&#39;s global pricing strategy across its semiconductor, connectivity, software, and platform solutions portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;This role sits at the center of Astera Labs&#39; commercial decision-making and is accountable for three outcomes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Define pricing and monetization strategies that strengthen competitive positioning, reflect customer value, and support profitable growth across existing and emerging businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Institutionalize pricing governance through clear policies, guardrails, approval models, and decision frameworks that improve speed, consistency, and discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Build a scalable pricing capability over time, including the processes, metrics, tools, and organizational foundations needed to support the company&#39;s next phase of growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate combines deep semiconductor industry experience with strong business acumen, financial expertise, market insight, and executive presence. This individual understands how technology differentiation, product performance, customer value, competitive dynamics, costs, and market demand interact to influence pricing decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;This leader must be equally effective shaping internal strategy and representing Astera Labs externally in senior-level customer and partner pricing discussions. They should be comfortable engaging directly with customer procurement, business, and product stakeholders, especially in complex or ambiguous situations where pricing positions are still being developed.&lt;/p&gt;
