&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Proficiency with industry-standard design and simulation tools (e.g., Cadence Virtuoso, Spectre) and solid layout/parasitic-aware design skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdnti _1ibi0s33y _1ibi0s34u&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
