&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2398&quot;&gt;Fluent in data processing using high level programming languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2398&quot;&gt;Experience in running External loopback at wafer sort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2467&quot;&gt;Familiarity with modern databases&lt;/li&gt;
