&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;Join Astera Labs’ Signal Connectivity Engineering team as a Principal &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;Engineer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt; shaping the firmware and software that makes advanced connectivity products adaptive, reliable, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;production-ready&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;. You will own embedded software across analog connectivity and Ethernet &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;retimer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt; platforms, from low-level hardware abstraction and calibration through link management, diagnostics, validation, and customer deployment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
