&lt;li style=&quot;margin-left: 15px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Specify test equipment, develop test fixtures, help improve hardware lab functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
