&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;As a Senior Design Verification Engineer, you will help define and deliver robust verification for next-generation connectivity silicon that enables rack-scale AI infrastructure. You will partner closely with RTL, architecture, firmware, and post-silicon teams to build verification strategies that prove complex switching behavior across high-bandwidth protocols and demanding system environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;This role offers the opportunity to own meaningful verification challenges within CCE2, from planning and testbench architecture through coverage closure and silicon learning. You will contribute to Astera Labs’ hyper-growth mission by helping deliver &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;highly reliable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt; PCIe and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;UALink&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt; connectivity products that keep AI accelerators, memory, and compute resources &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;operating&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt; at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
