&lt;ul class=&quot;wnfdnte&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntd _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;8+ years of hands-on experience with Oracle Cloud Fusion ERP Financial modules including General Ledger, Accounts Payable, Accounts Receivable, Fixed Assets, Subledger Accounting, and Revenue Recognition, Cash Management.&lt;/p&gt;
