&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in computer science, Information Systems, CPA or a related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntd _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Proven experience designing and implementing complex financial system architectures in large enterprise environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
