&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Experience supporting large-scale Oracle Cloud ERP implementations or transformations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
