&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking a&amp;nbsp;Senior&amp;nbsp;Packaging Integration&amp;nbsp;Lead&amp;nbsp;to serve as the single-threaded&amp;nbsp;packaging owner for one or more of Astera Labs’ advanced connectivity products. This role owns the end-to-end packaging solution from customer requirements&amp;nbsp;and package architecture definition through development, qualification, and production ramp&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;represents packaging across the customer, internal cross-functional teams, business units, and the OSAT, foundry, and substrate supply base.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:144,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:144,&amp;quot;335559745&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559746&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
