&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Astera Labs (NASDAQ: ALAB) provides rack-scale AI infrastructure through purpose-built connectivity solutions. By collaborating with hyperscalers and ecosystem partners, Astera Labs enables organizations to unlock the full potential of modern AI. Astera Labs’ Intelligent Connectivity Platform integrates CXL®, Ethernet, NVLink, PCIe®, and UALink™ semiconductor-based technologies with the company’s COSMOS software suite to unify diverse components into cohesive, flexible systems that deliver end-to-end scale-up, and scale-out connectivity. The company’s custom connectivity solutions business complements its standards-based portfolio, enabling customers to deploy tailored architectures to meet their unique infrastructure requirements. Discover more at &lt;a id=&quot;menurhut&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;http://www.asteralabs.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.asteralabs.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Principal Executive Recruiter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Principal Executive Recruiter will serve as a strategic talent advisor to executive leaders, helping Astera Labs understand its leadership needs before a requisition opens. translate business priorities into proactive executive talent strategies that support the company’s next phase of growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working six or more months ahead of anticipated hiring needs, you will combine semiconductor and silicon market intelligence with a deep understanding of Astera Labs’ organization. This fully in-person role in San Jose will shape how a hyper-growth company builds the leadership capacity required to advance rack-scale AI infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational &amp;amp; Executive Talent Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with executive leaders to understand business priorities, organizational design, and capability gaps across the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop rolling six-month executive talent plans that anticipate leadership needs well before roles are formally approved or posted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business growth plans into clear recommendations on which capabilities, leadership profiles, and talent pools Astera Labs should prioritize.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence &amp;amp; Strategic Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze semiconductor and silicon talent markets, competitor activity, talent availability, and leadership trends to inform planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders to surface emerging capability needs, align on future leadership priorities, and shape proactive talent strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use market insight and organizational context to challenge assumptions, sharpen role definitions, and guide investment in critical talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive Executive Pipeline Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with high-impact executives well before a requisition opens, creating durable pipelines for future priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop targeted talent maps for engineering and other executive functions across the semiconductor ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create engagement strategies that keep priority talent connected to Astera Labs’ mission, technology, and long-term opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Partnership &amp;amp; Search Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise senior stakeholders on leadership profiles, assessment criteria, and timing for opening critical roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a clear search strategy and decision framework, then guide execution from kickoff through close in alignment with the broader talent plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver concise executive-level updates that connect talent-market signals, organizational gaps, and recommended actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of relevant recruiting or talent acquisition experience, including at least 5 years focused on executive recruiting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must-have: Proven recruiting experience within the semiconductor, silicon, or adjacent hardware technology industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to understand organizational priorities, diagnose leadership gaps, and turn business needs into proactive talent plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record advising VP, C-suite, and other executive-level stakeholders on critical talent decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success closing candidates from Senior Director through C-suite roles, including navigating complex motivations, stakeholders, and offers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent judgment, discretion, communication skills, and ability to influence senior leaders in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading executive talent reviews, succession planning, workforce planning, or organization-design initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building talent intelligence frameworks that connect business strategy, capability gaps, market data, and future hiring priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established long-term relationships with senior leaders across semiconductor, silicon, hardware, systems, or related AI infrastructure markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with CEOs, executive leadership teams, and board-level stakeholders on multi-year leadership planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting across multiple executive functions, including engineering, product, operations, sales, or go-to-market leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3fd _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3eg&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Salary range is $190,000 to $240,000 depending on experience, level, and business need. This role may be eligible for discretionary bonus, incentives and benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We know that creativity and innovation happen more often when teams include diverse ideas, backgrounds, and experiences, and we actively encourage everyone with relevant experience to apply, including people of color, LGBTQ+ and non-binary people, veterans, parents, and individuals with disabilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

