&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience debugging issues across hardware, firmware, and software.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience validating high-speed interfaces such as PCIe, Ethernet, SerDes, CXL, or DDR.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience working in a hardware or system validation laboratory.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong communication and cross-functional collaboration skills.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
