&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with PVT validation, silicon corner testing, characterization, qualification, and margin analysis.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with server, storage, networking, or AI infrastructure products.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with PCIe/CXL architecture and high-speed SerDes technologies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with oscilloscopes,&amp;nbsp;BERTs, protocol&amp;nbsp;analyzers, traffic generators, or similar lab equipment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Working knowledge of Python, firmware, Linux, and system-level software debugging.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience developing automated validation and regression environments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with Git and software development practices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
