&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Site Human Resources Manager will oversee and manage all HR activities at the designated sites. This includes providing strategic HR support, ensuring compliance with labor laws, managing employee relations, administering compensation and benefits programs, and facilitating recruitment and training efforts. The Site HR Manager will work closely with site leadership and employees to foster a positive work environment and ensure that HR operations align with company goals and objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Site HR Administration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate employee records, ensure proper documentation, and track certifications, licenses, and other compliance-related activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage site employee database attendance, leave of absence, and scheduling requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with local, state, and federal labor laws and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with site leadership to maintain a safe and healthy work environment, ensuring adherence to health and safety regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support wellness initiatives to promote employee well-being and work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote and sustain a positive site culture in alignment with company values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and organize site events or initiatives to improve employee morale and foster team spirit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the administration of compensation and benefits programs for all employees at the site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that employees understand their benefits options and provide guidance on payroll, benefits, and other compensation-related inquiries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support any HR-related projects, initiatives, or company-wide programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with HR counterparts to drive global initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment &amp;amp; Onboarding:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the recruitment process, including job postings, strategy, interviewing, and hiring for all site positions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure smooth and efficient onboarding of new employees, including training on company policies, benefits, and site-specific procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Relations:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the first point of contact for employees regarding HR-related issues, concerns, and grievances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster positive employee relations and ensure a high level of employee engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mediate disputes and resolve conflicts in a fair and consistent manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Reporting &amp;amp; Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on key HR metrics, such as attrition, absenteeism, training completion, and employee satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular updates to leadership on HR-related activities, challenges, and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education: Masters degree in Human Resources, Business Administration, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: Minimum 10 years of experience in Human Resources, ideally with some experience in a multinational/US organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of labor laws and HR best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal, communication, and conflict resolution skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and manage multiple priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in HRIS systems, Microsoft Office Suite, and other HR-related tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May require occasional travel to other company sites or locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be flexible to work on-site and available during business hours, with occasional after-hours support as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We know that creativity and innovation happen more often when teams include diverse ideas, backgrounds, and experiences, and we actively encourage everyone with relevant experience to apply, including people of color, LGBTQ+ and non-binary people, veterans, parents, and individuals with disabilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Astera Labs (NASDAQ: ALAB) provides rack-scale AI infrastructure through purpose-built connectivity solutions. By collaborating with hyperscalers and ecosystem partners, Astera Labs enables organizations to unlock the full potential of modern AI. Astera Labs’ Intelligent Connectivity Platform integrates CXL®, Ethernet, NVLink, PCIe®, and UALink™ semiconductor-based technologies with the company’s COSMOS software suite to unify diverse components into cohesive, flexible systems that deliver end-to-end scale-up, and scale-out connectivity. The company’s custom connectivity solutions business complements its standards-based portfolio, enabling customers to deploy tailored architectures to meet their unique infrastructure requirements. Discover more at &lt;a id=&quot;menurhut&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;http://www.asteralabs.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.asteralabs.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Job Title: SoC Design Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced and highly motivated SoC Design Manager to lead a team of engineers responsible for the design and development of next-generation System-on-Chip (SoC) solutions. The ideal candidate will possess strong technical expertise in digital design, excellent leadership skills, and a proven track record of delivering complex SoC projects from architecture through silicon.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Technology Background&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;9&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience of working on complex, large SoCs on latest technology nodes under tight schedules. Exposure to chiplets is desirable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
