&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;MBA or advanced degree in Engineering, Computer Science, or Business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Direct experience supporting Open Compute / Open Rack ecosystems and engaging with hyperscale procurement and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
