&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Aachen, Germany&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;About the Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Test Engineer to join our high-tech assembly and test production facility. In this role, you will be responsible for validating that every device meets our rigorous performance and reliability standards before it reaches the customer. You will work closely with design and production teams to implement test solutions, troubleshoot failures, and optimize test coverage for high-volume manufacturing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Test Execution &amp;amp; Monitoring: Execute and monitor production test programs on Automated and Semi Auto Test Equipment&amp;nbsp; to identify manufacturing defects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Troubleshooting &amp;amp; Debugging: Perform basic hardware and software debugging to isolate the root cause of test failures, distinguishing between equipment malfunctions and actual product defects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Yield &amp;amp; Data Analysis: Analyze test data and performance metrics to identify trends, monitor process stability, and support yield improvement initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;NPI Support: Assist in the bring-up and qualification of new products by helping to develop and validate test plans, scripts, and hardware interfaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Maintenance &amp;amp; Calibration: Ensure test systems and fixtures are properly calibrated and performing as intended to maintain accurate data collection.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Documentation: Maintain detailed documentation for test procedures, bug tracking, and compliance reports in alignment with industry standards like ISO.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Qualification:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Education: Bachelor’s degree in Electrical Engineering, Electronics, Computer Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Experience: 0–2 years of experience in electronics testing or manufacturing. Relevant internships or university projects involving measurement or lab instrumentation are highly preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Basic programming and scripting skills (e.g., Python, C/C++, or LabVIEW) for test automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Familiarity with lab equipment such as oscilloscopes, digital multimeters, and signal generators.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Understanding of digital logic, CMOS fundamentals, and semiconductor device physics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Soft Skills:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Strong analytical mindset with an interest in finding and solving complex &quot;puzzle-like&quot; hardware problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Effective communication for reporting technical issues to cross-functional engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with advanced semiconductor testing technology and ATE platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Structured career progression and mentorship from senior process engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package and comprehensive benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Aptos; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
